  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/FernandoPonceRecogePremioMaratonFotografico.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 269px;\" /></p>\n<p>(15 fotos) Fernando Ponce ha obtenido el primer premio, entre las 42 personas que hab&iacute;an quedado finalistas en el Marat&oacute;n Fotogr&aacute;fico de Castell&oacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/DavidMeleroRecogePremioMaratonFotografico.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 269px;\" /></p>\n<p>David Melero se lleva el premio especial Action Sport Photography,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/JavierJoseAlbaViciano1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 310px;\" /></p>\n<p>Javier Jos&eacute; Viciano consigue otro galard&oacute;n especial y su hija Alba Viciano, el tercer premio general.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/OndensesPremioMaratonFotograficoCS.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n ha llegado a la final Roberto Abril, igualmente de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/albavicianoparra1.jpg\" alt=\"albavicianoparra1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/albavicianoparra2.jpg\" alt=\"albavicianoparra2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/davidmelero.jpg\" alt=\"davidmelero\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/davidmelerorecogepremiomaratonfotografico.jpg\" alt=\"davidmelerorecogepremiomaratonfotografico\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/fernandoponce-1.jpg\" alt=\"fernandoponce-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/fernandoponce-2.jpg\" alt=\"fernandoponce-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/fernandoponcerecogepremiomaratonfotografico.jpg\" alt=\"fernandoponcerecogepremiomaratonfotografico\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/javierjoseviciano1.jpg\" alt=\"javierjoseviciano1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/javierjoseviciano2.jpg\" alt=\"javierjoseviciano2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/robertoabril1.jpg\" alt=\"robertoabril1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/robertoabril2.jpg\" alt=\"robertoabril2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/albajavierjosevicianomaratonfotograficocs.jpg\" alt=\"albajavierjosevicianomaratonfotograficocs\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/finalistasmaratonfotograficocs.jpg\" alt=\"finalistasmaratonfotograficocs\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/javierjosealbaviciano1.jpg\" alt=\"javierjosealbaviciano1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisdefinitiusondersmaratofotograficcastello16/ondensespremiomaratonfotograficocs.jpg\" alt=\"ondensespremiomaratonfotograficocs\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
